# PROJECT: TALES FROM THE GAME
## Complete Website Build, Content Strategy, SEO, AEO and Growth Marketing Implementation

You are a senior full-stack developer, UI/UX designer, technical SEO specialist, cricket researcher, editorial strategist and growth marketer.

Your task is to build a complete, responsive, production-oriented website for **Tales from the Game**, an independent cricket storytelling publication.

Do not create a static mockup, a generic sports blog, a website template with placeholder content, or a supplement brand website.

Build a real, functional website with working navigation, reusable components, complete launch articles, page-specific metadata, technical SEO, responsive layouts and the infrastructure required to measure growth marketing experiments.

Where external services require API keys, credentials, a real domain or account access, implement the appropriate integration points and explain exactly how to configure them. Never pretend that an integration is active when it has not been connected and verified.

Prioritise the requirements in this prompt. Do not omit major requirements simply to make the initial implementation easier.

